  m_text: 'Welcome, Adventurer!


    You have discovered The Secrets of C#, an ancient
    tome filled with the knowledge you need to master the mystical art of programming.
    Within these pages, you will uncover the hidden truths of variables, data types,
    and logic, tools that will allow you to reshape the world around you.


    To
    progress in your adventure, you must learn the language of C# and apply it wisely.
    Study these pages carefully, for the challenges ahead will test your understanding.'
