  m_text: "C# (pronounced \"C-Sharp\") is a powerful programming language used to
    create applications, games, and digital worlds. Just as a wizard casts spells
    using incantations, programmers use C# code to bring logic and interactivity
    to life.\n\nWith C#, you can:\n* Store information in variables \n* Make decisions
    using logic \n* Control movement and actions \n* Create objects and systems \n\nAs
    you journey through this world, mastering C# will be key to overcoming obstacles
    and unlocking secrets."
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: b0aae22f55f1cf54c8768d2a8854e9ad, type: 2}
